 can you see animals?","f":"u2_03.mp3"},{"t":"They eat rabbits, frogs and birds.","f":"u2_04.mp3"},{"t":"Owls come out at night.","f":"u2_05.mp3"},{"t":"They eat mice and snakes.","f":"u2_06.mp3"},{"t":"Eagles live in big nests.","f":"u2_07.mp3"},{"t":"Where are their nests?","f":"u2_08.mp3"},{"t":"They are in the trees.","f":"u2_09.mp3"},{"t":"Where do owls live?","f":"u2_10.mp3"},{"t":"They live in tree holes.","f":"u2_11.mp3"},{"t":"They are safe there.","f":"u2_12.mp3"},{"t":"Honeybees live in a hive.","f":"u2_13.mp3"},{"t":"There, they make honey.","f":"u2_14.mp3"},{"t":"They have food in winter.","f":"u2_15.mp3"},{"t":"Honeybees have five eyes.","f":"u2_16.mp3"},{"t":"Where do some other animals live?","f":"u2_17.mp3"},{"t":"Where is the eagle?","f":"u2_18.mp3"},{"t":"Is it in the tree?","f":"u2_19.mp3"},{"t":"No, it isn’t.","f":"u2_20.mp3"},{"t":"Are they in the hive?","f":"u2_21.mp3"},{"t":"Yes, they are.","f":"u2_22.mp3"},{"t":"They’re in the hive!","f":"u2_23.mp3"},{"t":"Where’s the frog?","f":"u2_24.mp3"},{"t":"Where’s the eagle?","f":"u2_25.mp3"},{"t":"It’s under the tree.","f":"u2_26.mp3"},{"t":"Where are the baby eagles?","f":"u2_27.mp3"},{"t":"They’re in the nest.","f":"u2_28.mp3"},{"t":"Can you talk about these animals’ homes?","f":"u2_29.mp3"},{"t":"Why do these animals live in these places?","f":"u2_30.mp3"},{"t":"What animals do you like?","f":"u2_31.mp3"},{"t":"Where do they live?","f":"u2_32.mp3"},{"t":"What do they look like?","f":"u2_33.mp3"},{"t":"Where do the birds live?","f":"u2_34.mp3"},{"t":"They live in the nest.","f":"u2_35.mp3"}]},{"unit":3,"pages":"26-34","bigQuestion":"How do we use numbers?","grammar":"How many ... do we have? We have ... ... don’t have ...","words":["odd numbers","even numbers","plus","minus","equal","answer"],"sents":[{"t":"How do we use numbers?","f":"u3_01.mp3"},{"t":"A Numbers in Maths What do you know about numbers?","f":"u3_02.mp3"},{"t":"Ten hat s!","f":"u3_03.mp3"},{"t":"Tanya loves hats.","f":"u3_04.mp3"},