 are.","f":"u4_42.mp3"},{"t":"Let me see.","f":"u4_43.mp3"}]},{"unit":5,"pages":"46-54","bigQuestion":"How are the seasons different?","grammar":"It gets / snows ... It doesn’t get / snow ...","words":["spring","warm","summer","hot","autumn","cool","winter","cold"],"sents":[{"t":"How are the seasons different?","f":"u5_01.mp3"},{"t":"It’s warm and rainy.","f":"u5_02.mp3"},{"t":"Can you see the red apples on the tree?","f":"u5_03.mp3"},{"t":"There are four seasons in a year: spring, summer, autumn and winter.","f":"u5_04.mp3"},{"t":"Summer days are long and hot.","f":"u5_05.mp3"},{"t":"Plants grow in spring.","f":"u5_06.mp3"},{"t":"It gets warm.","f":"u5_07.mp3"},{"t":"It usually rains a lot.","f":"u5_08.mp3"},{"t":"The rain helps plants grow.","f":"u5_09.mp3"},{"t":"Summer comes after spring.","f":"u5_10.mp3"},{"t":"It gets hot.","f":"u5_11.mp3"},{"t":"The days are long and the nights are short.","f":"u5_12.mp3"},{"t":"The sun helps fruit and flowers grow.","f":"u5_13.mp3"},{"t":"Winter days are short and cold.","f":"u5_14.mp3"},{"t":"Leaves fall in autumn.","f":"u5_15.mp3"},{"t":"Winter comes after autumn.","f":"u5_16.mp3"},{"t":"The days are short and the nights are long.","f":"u5_17.mp3"},{"t":"It gets cold and it often snows!","f":"u5_18.mp3"},{"t":"Many trees don’t have leaves.","f":"u5_19.mp3"},{"t":"It gets cool.","f":"u5_20.mp3"},{"t":"Then it’s spring!","f":"u5_21.mp3"},{"t":"The seasons begin again.","f":"u5_22.mp3"},{"t":"How do things change in each season?","f":"u5_23.mp3"},{"t":"In winter, many trees don’t have leaves.","f":"u5_24.mp3"},{"t":"In autumn, leaves turn red, yellow and orange.","f":"u5_25.mp3"},{"t":"In spring, the rain helps plants grow.","f":"u5_26.mp3"},{"t":"What is each season like in your city?","f":"u5_27.mp3"},{"t":"Winter B Summer is my favourite season.","f":"u5_28.mp3"},{"t":"It gets hot in summer.","f":"u5_29.mp3"},{"t":"Days are long, and nights are short.","f":"u5_30.mp3"},{"t":"I like summer.","f":"u5_31.mp3"},{"t":"But it’s 