!","f":"u6_20.mp3"},{"t":"The plant is big and strong.","f":"u6_21.mp3"},{"t":"And now it has green leaves.","f":"u6_22.mp3"},{"t":"The flowers are very small.","f":"u6_23.mp3"},{"t":"And they make little seeds.","f":"u6_24.mp3"},{"t":"In spring, it gets warm.","f":"u6_25.mp3"},{"t":"The tree has many flowers.","f":"u6_26.mp3"},{"t":"What is in the school garden?","f":"u6_27.mp3"},{"t":"What do the plants look like?","f":"u6_28.mp3"},{"t":"What other plants do you know?","f":"u6_29.mp3"},{"t":"What is amazing about them?","f":"u6_30.mp3"},{"t":"I put the seed in the soil.","f":"u6_31.mp3"}]},{"unit":7,"pages":"66-74","bigQuestion":"How do we keep safe on the road?","grammar":"Wait ... Don’t play ...","words":["green light","red light","wait","cross"],"sents":[{"t":"How do we keep safe on the road?on the road?","f":"u7_01.mp3"},{"t":"First, look left and right.","f":"u7_02.mp3"},{"t":"Please don’t run.","f":"u7_03.mp3"},{"t":"Let’s cross the road.","f":"u7_04.mp3"},{"t":"What should we do first?","f":"u7_05.mp3"},{"t":"Yaoyao: It’s safe to cross.","f":"u7_06.mp3"},{"t":"Qiqi: I like walking to school.","f":"u7_07.mp3"},{"t":"Yaoyao: I don’t like walking.","f":"u7_08.mp3"},{"t":"Can I ride a bike to school?","f":"u7_09.mp3"},{"t":"The light is green.","f":"u7_10.mp3"},{"t":"No, sorry, kids.","f":"u7_11.mp3"},{"t":"We can’t skate on the road.","f":"u7_12.mp3"},{"t":"It’s not safe.","f":"u7_13.mp3"},{"t":"How do the children keep safe on the road?","f":"u7_14.mp3"},{"t":"What other road safety rules do you know?","f":"u7_15.mp3"},{"t":"Can I skate to school?","f":"u7_16.mp3"},{"t":"No, you can’t.","f":"u7_17.mp3"},{"t":"I see a red light.","f":"u7_18.mp3"},{"t":"What does it mean?","f":"u7_19.mp3"},{"t":"Until it turns green.","f":"u7_20.mp3"},{"t":"Now the light is green.","f":"u7_21.mp3"},{"t":"It’s OK to go.","f":"u7_22.mp3"},{"t":"But don’t walk too slow.","f":"u7_23.mp3"},{"t":"What should we do on the road?","f":"u7_24.mp3"},{"t":"Don’t play on the road.","f":"u7_25.mp3"},{"t":"What can you learn from the quiz?","f":"u7_26.mp3"},{"t":"Why are road safety rules important?","f":"u7_27.mp3"},{"t":"A Children under 12 years old can’t ride on the road.","f":"u7_28.mp3"}]},{"unit":8,"pages":"76-84","bigQuestion":"What do our grandparents do?","grammar":"Review","words":["go shopping","go for a walk","use the internet","do exercise","do housework","do gardening"],"sents":[{"t":"What do our grandparents do?","f":"u8_01.mp3"},{"t":"They do exercise there.","f":"u8_02.mp3"},{"t":"They can cook nice food.","f":"u8_03.mp3"},{"t":"They often sing with their friends.","f":"u8_04.mp3"},{"t":"It’s Sunday morning.","f":"u8_05.mp3"},{"t":"Every morning, they go for a walk in the park.","f":"u8_06.mp3"},{"t":"They often do tai chi with their friends there.","f":"u8_07.mp3"},{"t":"He has lots of plants.","f":"u8_08.mp3"},{"t":"They look great.","f":"u8_09.mp3"},{"t":"What do Junjun’s grandparents do every day?","f":"u8_10.mp3"},{"t":"Lots of people watch it.","f":"u8_11.mp3"},{"t":"What are your grandparents’ lives like?","f":"u8_12.mp3"},{"t":"Think and talk.","f":"u8_13.mp3"},{"t":"Junjun do with his grandparents?","f":"u8_14.mp3"},{"t":"In winter, it gets cold.","f":"u8_15.mp3"},{"t":"I visit my grandparents’ farm.","f":"u8_16.mp3"},{"t":"In spring, it’s warm and sunny.","f":"u8_17.mp3"},{"t":"We walk in the park.","f":"u8_18.mp3"},{"t":"In summer, it gets hot.","f":"u8_19.mp3"},{"t":"We stay at home a lot.","f":"u8_20.mp3"},{"t":"In autumn, the leaves change colour.","f":"u8_21.mp3"},{"t":"We go for a long bike ride.","f":"u8_22.mp3"},{"t":"What do I do with my grandparents?","f":"u8_23.mp3"},{"t":"You do a lot of things with your grandparents.","f":"u8_24.mp3"},{"t":"It gets warm in spring.","f":"u8_25.mp3"},{"t":"What hobbies do your grandparents have?","f":"u8_26.mp3"},{"t":"What do your grandparents like doing?","f":"u8_27.mp3"}]}]}